msgid ""
"A race condition occurred in certain graph-related applications when "
"pending asynchronous signal handlers referenced device memory that had "
"already been released, leading to memory corruption. HIP runtime now uses"
" a reference counting strategy to manage access to device objects in "
"asynchronous event handlers, ensuring safe and reliable memory usage."
