"`DOWNLOAD`, below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../release/changelog.md:1161 ../../release/changelog.md:1761
msgid ""
"`DOWNLOAD` - downloads the dependency from the rocm-libraries repository."
" If git >= 2.25 is present, this option uses a sparse checkout that "
"avoids downloading more than it needs to. If not, the whole monorepo is "
"downloaded (this may take some time)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../release/changelog.md:1162
msgid ""
"`MONOREPO` - this option is intended to be used if you are building "
"hipCUB from within a copy of the rocm-libraries repository that you have "
"cloned (and therefore already contains rocPRIM). When selected, the build"
" will try find the dependency in the local repository tree. If it cannot "
"be found, the build will attempt to use git to perform a sparse-checkout "
"of rocPRIM. If that also fails, it will fall back to using the `DOWNLOAD`"
" option described above."
