" capability of how many compute dies (chiplets, xcc) are available on a "
"given GPU. Developers can get this attribute via the API "
"`hipDeviceGetAttribute`, to make use of the best cache locality in a "
"kernel, and optimize the Kernel launch grid layout, for performance "
"improvement."
msgstr ""

