msgid ""
"Removal of `hipRTC` symbols from HIP Runtime Library. Any application "
"using `hipRTC` APIs should link explicitly with the `hipRTC` library. "
"This makes the usage of `hipRTC` library on Linux the same as on Windows "
"and matches the behavior of CUDA `nvRTC`."
