#: ../../release/changelog.md:6328 ../../release/changelog.md:6475
msgid ""
"On systems running Linux kernel 6.8.0, such as Ubuntu 24.04, Direct "
"Memory Access (DMA) transfers between the GPU and NIC are disabled and "
"impacts multi-node RCCL performance. This issue was reproduced with RCCL "
"2.20.5 (ROCm 6.2.0 and 6.2.1) on systems with Broadcom Thor-2 NICs and "
