"`DeviceRadixSort` that expose a `decomposer` argument. Keys of a custom "
"type (`key_type`) can be sorted via these overloads, if an appropriate "
"decomposer is passed. The decomposer has to implement `operator(const "
"key_type&)` which returns a `hipcub::tuple` of references pointing to "
"members of `key_type`."
msgstr ""

