"used inside of HIP graphs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../release/changelog.md:6741
msgid ""
"Deprecated `debug_synchronous` in hipCUB-2.13.2, and it no longer has any"
" effect. With this release, passing `debug_synchronous` to the device "
"functions results in a deprecation warning both at runtime and at compile"
" time."
msgstr ""

